WEBVTT

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:02.363
which takes the focus off
of the person you've harmed.

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:07.863
[How do you keep yourself from buying into
feelings of internalized shame?]

00:06:07.897 --> 00:06:11.630
Oh, yes -- buying into internalized shame,
that's a really good question.

00:06:11.663 --> 00:06:15.563
I think, first of all, finding
a good, supportive group

00:06:15.597 --> 00:06:21.230
and also finding ways to celebrate

00:06:21.263 --> 00:06:24.430
and to appreciate

00:06:24.463 --> 00:06:29.830
the strengths and the beauties
of one's group,

00:06:29.863 --> 00:06:33.930
even if it's stigmatized by the community.